00:09:22.395 --> 00:09:25.631 line:85%
I HAD TO GO OUT.

00:09:24.730 --> 00:09:27.500 line:85%
&gt;&gt; YOU ARE BASICALLY A RECLUSE,

00:09:25.865 --> 00:09:28.334 line:85%
BUT NOT BY CHOICE.

00:09:27.667 --> 00:09:30.403 line:85%
&gt;&gt; I CANNOT AFFORD IT.

00:09:28.434 --> 00:09:31.837 line:85%
HOW CAN YOU LIVE IN NEW YORK AND

00:09:30.503 --> 00:09:33.873 line:85%
NOT BE DISGUSTED ALL THE TIME?

00:09:31.938 --> 00:09:35.675 line:85%
YOU SEE A GUY WIPING HIS ON THE

00:09:33.973 --> 00:09:37.243 line:85%
SUBWAY AND I AM SUPPOSED TO BE

00:09:36.208 --> 00:09:39.845 line:85%
CONSIDERED NEUROTIC FOR NOT

00:09:37.743 --> 00:09:41.714 line:85%
WANTING TO TOUCH ANYTHING?

00:09:40.046 --> 00:09:42.582 line:85%
&gt;&gt; TO BE FAIR, JESSE WATTERS

00:09:41.814 --> 00:09:43.616 line:85%
