00:09:51.891 --> 00:09:56.829 line:85%
I THINK YOU ARE STILL WRONG.

00:09:54.260 --> 00:09:59.265 line:85%
I WILL SAY THIS.

00:09:57.096 --> 00:10:00.266 line:85%
I THANK GOD FOR HOWARD STERN.

00:09:59.365 --> 00:10:03.202 line:85%
HE DOES MAKE ME FEEL NORMAL BY

00:10:00.366 --> 00:10:04.637 line:85%
COMPARISON.

00:10:03.536 --> 00:10:06.272 line:85%
I AM LIKE A FOX RECLUSE.

00:10:05.338 --> 00:10:06.973 line:85%
I DON'T DO ANYTHING OR GO

00:10:06.706 --> 00:10:07.607 line:85%
ANYWHERE.

00:10:07.073 --> 00:10:11.744 line:85%
HE MAKES ME LOOK LIKE PETE

00:10:07.707 --> 00:10:13.079 line:85%
DAVIDSON.

00:10:12.278 --> 00:10:14.847 line:85%
&gt;&gt; HE'S A GERMOPHOBE.

00:10:13.179 --> 00:10:16.449 line:85%
HIS WIFE RESCUES CATS.

00:10:14.947 --> 00:10:16.816 line:85%
THAT'S HER JOB, APPARENTLY.

00:10:16.549 --> 00:10:22.288 line:85%
HER THING.

