&gt;&gt; WHAT ARE THE CHANCES I GET

00:10:28.894 --> 00:10:32.598 line:85%
THAT AGAIN?

00:10:29.362 --> 00:10:35.434 line:85%
&gt;&gt; A LOT OF RELATED.

00:10:32.698 --> 00:10:36.836 line:85%
GIARDIA, RINGWORM.

00:10:35.601 --> 00:10:39.872 line:85%
&gt;&gt; THAT IS SUCH A GREAT NAME FOR

00:10:36.936 --> 00:10:41.540 line:85%
A LEAD SINGER.

00:10:40.039 --> 00:10:41.841 line:85%
&gt;&gt; I GOT IT FROM STREAM WATER

00:10:41.641 --> 00:10:44.310 line:85%
ONES.

00:10:41.941 --> 00:10:48.848 line:85%
IT WAS ATROCIOUS.

00:10:44.477 --> 00:10:50.650 line:85%
&gt;&gt; THAT'S WHAT THEY CALLED IT?

00:10:48.948 --> 00:10:51.550 line:85%
WHEN A GUY IS STANDING OVER YOU

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:54.887 line:85%
