00:10:51.651 --> 00:10:57.356 line:85%
WATER.

00:10:55.054 --> 00:10:58.024 line:85%
&gt;&gt; THAT PAYS REALLY WELL.

00:10:57.456 --> 00:11:03.996 line:85%
DON'T KNOCK IT UNTIL YOU'VE

00:10:58.124 --> 00:11:05.665 line:85%
TRIED IT.

00:11:04.163 --> 00:11:06.465 line:85%
&gt;&gt; I DON'T KNOW HOW YOU ARE A

00:11:05.765 --> 00:11:07.600 line:85%
GERMOPHOBE AND LIVE IN NEW YORK

00:11:06.565 --> 00:11:09.235 line:85%
CITY.

00:11:07.700 --> 00:11:09.802 line:85%
THERE ARE PEOPLE LIKE STERN WHO

00:11:09.335 --> 00:11:12.405 line:85%
HAVE BARELY LEFT THEIR

00:11:09.902 --> 00:11:13.606 line:85%
APARTMENTS EXCEPT TO SMOKE ON

00:11:12.505 --> 00:11:14.373 line:85%
THE STREET FOR THE LAST TWO AND

00:11:13.706 --> 00:11:15.841 line:85%
A HALF YEARS.

00:11:14.473 --> 00:11:17.510 line:85%
YOU CAN SEE THEM BECAUSE WHEN

00:11:16.075 --> 00:11:18.878 line:85%
YOU ARE WALKING TOWARDS THEM

00:11:17.877 --> 00:11:21.847 line:85%
THEY ALWAYS DO THIS.

00:11:18.978 --> 00:11:24.583 line:85%
AND THEY LOOK AT YOU LIKE YOU

00:11:21.947 --> 00:11:25.084 line:85%
ARE SOME SORT OF GIANT WALKING

00:11:24.684 --> 00:11:26.952 line:85%
CONTAGIOUS TUMOR.

00:11:25.184 --> 00:11:28.721 line:85%
HERE IS HOW YOU ENSURE THAT THEY

00:11:27.053 --> 00:11:31.290 line:85%
STAY IN THEIR APARTMENT FOREVER.

00:11:28.821 --> 00:11:36.295 line:85%
YOU COUGH, SNEEZE, DO A NOSE

00:11:31.390 --> 00:11:40.099 line:85%
PICK OR DO THE 1-2 PUNCH WHICH

00:11:36.395 --> 00:11:47.707 line:85%
IS THIS AND THIS AND YOU COME AT

00:11:40.199 --> 00:11:50.609 line:85%
THEM.

00:11:47.840 --> 00:11:51.377 line:85%
YOU WON'T BE SEEING THAT ON

00:11:50.710 --> 00:11:54.947 line:85%
SPECIAL REPORT.

00:11:51.544 --> 00:11:55.648 line:85%
&gt;&gt; KENNEDY, YOU LOOK MARVELOUS.

00:11:55.047 --> 00:11:59.418 line:85%
THEY HAVE A SALE AT SPENCER'S

00:11:55.748 --> 00:12:00.853 line:85%
GIFTS?

