I HAVE A THEORY.

00:12:04.390 --> 00:12:09.061 line:85%
WHEN LIFE IS SO GOOD, YOU BECOME

00:12:08.060 --> 00:12:10.696 line:85%
MORE AND MORE TERRIFIED OF

00:12:09.161 --> 00:12:13.032 line:85%
