00:12:14.300 --> 00:12:16.769 line:85%
WITH HIS WEALTH AND PRESTIGE.

00:12:15.401 --> 00:12:19.138 line:85%
IT'S LIKE HE DOESN'T THINK IT

00:12:16.869 --> 00:12:20.272 line:85%
WILL GET ANY BETTER THAN BEING

00:12:19.238 --> 00:12:22.041 line:85%
HERE.

00:12:20.439 --> 00:12:23.008 line:85%
&gt;&gt; TO YOUR POINT, HOWARD HAS

00:12:22.141 --> 00:12:26.378 line:85%
ALWAYS BEEN THIS WAY.

00:12:23.109 --> 00:12:27.646 line:85%
HE HAS ALWAYS BEEN MAKING HIS

00:12:26.479 --> 00:12:30.049 line:85%
CAREER ON NEUROSIS.

