HE HAS BEEN VERY HONEST ABOUT

00:12:30.149 --> 00:12:33.152 line:85%
GOING TO ANALYSIS.

00:12:32.151 --> 00:12:35.855 line:85%
NOT JUST THERAPY.

00:12:33.252 --> 00:12:36.622 line:85%
FIVE DAY A WEAK ANALYSIS.

00:12:35.955 --> 00:12:38.491 line:85%
HE'S BEEN UNHINGED AND NUTS AND

00:12:36.722 --> 00:12:42.428 line:85%
OBSESSED WITH.

