&gt;&gt; WHO IS LIKE THAT?

00:12:42.595 --> 00:12:44.096 line:85%
&gt;&gt; I DON'T KNOW.

00:12:43.062 --> 00:12:48.667 line:85%
THAT'S SO WEIRD THAT IT TAKES

00:12:44.196 --> 00:12:51.337 line:85%
ONE TO KNOW ONE.

00:12:48.834 --> 00:12:51.837 line:85%
&gt;&gt; I AM JUST FASCINATED WITH THE

00:12:51.437 --> 00:12:54.440 line:85%
DIGESTIVE SYSTEM.

